# Freebuff desktop runtime artifacts — not source, never commit.
# SQLite session/conversation databases and preview server logs change on
# every run; they belong to the local machine, not the repo.
**/.freebuff/desktop-v2.db
**/.freebuff/desktop-v2.db-shm
**/.freebuff/desktop-v2.db-wal
**/.freebuff/preview*.log
**/.freebuff/preview-*.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
